exists su name video cuts audio filename ob text "/workplace/artifacts/say/love-teaching-shorts.wav" be default ya
exists su name video cuts prefix ob text "love-teaching-shorts" be default ya

su name draw size shorts be map def
  su name width ob num 720 ya
  su name height ob num 1280 ya
prah

su name love teaching shorts be refinery def

su name manuscript ob text "Write a spoken teaching manuscript that teaches people how to love God. Focus on concrete actions humans can take to love God. About 90 words. Plain language." for name mind to name text manuscript out be write do

su name telling from ve name manuscript ob name manuscript out to filename "/workplace/artifacts/say/love-teaching-shorts.wav" be piper say do

su name hear from ve name telling from filename "/workplace/artifacts/say/love-teaching-shorts.wav" become wo srt to filename "/workplace/artifacts/footnote/love-teaching-shorts.srt" be hear do

su name cut platform from filename "/workplace/artifacts/footnote/love-teaching-shorts.srt" during num 6 to name itinerary teaching cuts be cut do

su name draw platform from name itinerary teaching cuts ob text "Create one illustration representing the meaing of the text in an uplifting way, if there is any text it should be brief and at the top. be inspired by the following transcript:" fromstate wo text become wo photograph with name draw size shorts as text "love-teaching-shorts" be draw do

su name concatenate platform from name itinerary teaching cuts fromstate wo itinerary become wo video be concatenate do

su name report ob text "Generated teaching shorts video in run artifacts folder." be write do
prah

from name love teaching shorts be refinery do
ob text "love teaching shorts complete." be write do
